Hand over current state pending work and the evidence needed to continue (@engineering-operation-handover: 0, is #chapter, #hephaestus-core "Connect-operating-evidence-to-the-major-engineering-disciplines.lingua#r_00E446205CFF984E3AE1329789") { r_00F01DCD35E9090CCE1C4098DD
Reuse [Hand over a practical method and make its limits observable](../../inquiry/core/Hand-over-a-practical-method-and-make-its-limits-observable.lingua#r_003F2F980FE4FCF88BC8DFD75D) for demonstration, guided practice, independent work and changed-condition evidence. Here the handover object is continuing operational responsibility: what is the current configuration, what remains in progress, what has changed and what evidence supports the next action? Passing a document and demonstrating the recipient's ability to act are different achievements.

The selected HSE handover reading in [HSE human failure procedures and shift handover](../sources/HSE-human-failure-procedures-and-shift-handover.lingua#r_005E57B92B1E14D9A4710D1943) connects preparation, exchange and incoming cross-checks. Reconstruct that argument with an original two-person paper exercise. The outgoing person records the mode, counts, pending work, observation time and any uncertain step. The incoming person compares that account with the board and explains the next permitted actions. A disagreement is retained and investigated before pretending a shared state has been established. Spoken explanation can reveal assumptions missing from a terse form; a written account can preserve details that speech alone loses. No actual participant session is claimed here.

For the exact finite model, ask which current state fields determine the permitted command set. Counts alone fail: (2,0,0,false,hold) permits resume, whereas (2,0,0,true,hold) does not. The code enumerates every subset of the five fields and finds three minimal sufficient selections: mode, pending and any two of I,B,F. The third count follows from conservation. Prove sufficiency algebraically, and show a pair of indistinguishable states with different enabled commands whenever a field is removed from one of those selections. This is sufficiency for the defined command set under current exact readings, not a universal minimum handover form.

Real work adds identity, equipment configuration, measurement status, authority, unresolved faults, task purpose and changes over time. Even a full snapshot can become stale before use. A concise handover should preserve these relevant meanings without becoming a detached checklist. [Systems Engineering Handbook — NASA](../mechanical-engineering-and-machine-design/sources/Systems-Engineering-Handbook-NASA.lingua#r_7ZQFZ9E1NAVG27SE2R5S24PDBQ), section 5.5, supplies transition context: product, supporting information, receiving setting and readiness belong in the account. Its institutional procedures are not universal requirements.

**Work:** make a one-page handover and a separate observation sheet. Use one pending-request case and one already-completed case. Record prompts and assistance if the exercise is later conducted. Ask the recipient to explain an unexpected state and revise the handover based on the evidence. A successful rehearsal supports only the specified task and conditions; it does not certify operation of actual machinery.

